{"term":{"label":"道","occurrences":8,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"4B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii","title":"離婁下","description":"孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"事","id":"事"},{"form":"反","id":"反"},{"form":"君子","id":"君子"},{"form":"善","id":"善"},{"form":"執","id":"執"},{"form":"夫子","id":"夫子"},{"form":"子思","id":"子思"},{"form":"學","id":"學"},{"form":"居","id":"居"},{"form":"思","id":"思"},{"form":"曾子","id":"曾子"},{"form":"水","id":"水"},{"form":"禹","id":"禹"},{"form":"羿","id":"羿"},{"form":"足","id":"足"},{"form":"道","id":"道"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.2925347571405443,"source":"學","target":"羿"},{"weight":2.0693912058263346,"source":"學","target":"夫子"},{"weight":2.580216829592325,"source":"曾子","target":"居"},{"weight":1.1939224684724346,"source":"曾子","target":"反"},{"weight":2.9856819377004897,"source":"曾子","target":"子思"},{"weight":1.7329189692051217,"source":"曾子","target":"道"},{"weight":2.515678308454754,"source":"思","target":"羿"},{"weight":2.1102132003465894,"source":"思","target":"禹"},{"weight":2.2925347571405443,"source":"足","target":"事"},{"weight":1.9560625205193314,"source":"足","target":"道"},{"weight":0.8574502318512216,"source":"道","target":"君子"},{"weight":1.9560625205193314,"source":"道","target":"羿"},{"weight":0.8574502318512216,"source":"道","target":"反"},{"weight":1.7329189692051217,"source":"道","target":"夫子"},{"weight":1.550597412411167,"source":"道","target":"禹"},{"weight":1.262915339959386,"source":"道","target":"善"},{"weight":1.9560625205193314,"source":"道","target":"子思"},{"weight":1.1939224684724346,"source":"反","target":"夫子"},{"weight":1.0116009116784799,"source":"反","target":"君子"},{"weight":2.803360380906535,"source":"子思","target":"居"},{"weight":2.580216829592325,"source":"事","target":"水"},{"weight":1.8870696490323797,"source":"事","target":"禹"},{"weight":3.09104